-- Seed of the team's real (actual) 2026 operating results by market and
-- vertical, as tracked weekly by the traffic team in their own results
-- spreadsheet, as of 2026-09-22 (Enero-Septiembre; ~40-45 market/vertical
-- rows per month incl. Colombia/Brasil/Affiliate/misc lines not present
-- in witme_targets_monthly). Kept current going forward by the weekly
-- sync (Parte 7). A handful of markets (Brasil) only ever had a single
-- vertical row in the source sheet -- their market-total (vertical='')
-- row here is this script's own sum of that market's verticals, not a
-- row that existed in the sheet itself.

on conflict (year, month, market, vertical) do update set
  responsable = excluded.responsable,
  revenue = excluded.revenue,
  cost = excluded.cost,
  cost_tools = excluded.cost_tools,
  profit = excluded.profit,
  roi_pct = excluded.roi_pct,
  revenue_campaigns = excluded.revenue_campaigns,
  revenue_monetization = excluded.revenue_monetization,
  revenue_adsense = excluded.revenue_adsense,
  roi_campaigns_pct = excluded.roi_campaigns_pct,
  pct_objetivo_profit = excluded.pct_objetivo_profit,
  pct_objetivo_facturacion = excluded.pct_objetivo_facturacion;
